    <string name="settings_limits_title">What OmniShield does not do</string>
    <string name="settings_limits_body">It has no account and no server: filtering happens on this device and nothing about your traffic leaves it. It cannot filter inside apps that use HTTPS, except browsers you explicitly opt in on the Web tab. It cannot block ads served from the same domain as the content around them.</string>
